<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Bɛkwyel Bible</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timote</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Tm</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timote</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl yii Mɛkɛn nyɛ nakwyal Timote ɛ</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl yii Mɛkɛn nyɛ nakwyal</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timote ɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Sɛɛg ɛ Timote nabɛ ɛ́ mot mbyak eGhɛlɛk, nyɛɛg nabɛ ɛ́ mot mbyak eYuda. Nyɛɛg naazɛdum koŋ nɛ Klisto. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, é mɛdjoŋ mɛ ebá ɛ Pɔl yii ɛkɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ nyɛ naboma bɛ nɛ Timote é sok mɛkɛn tɔ ghaada Lisetɛ pɛ kyee dik Azi (di edjóoaa mos Tuulki ɛ, tɔ <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 16:1-3">Mɛs 16.1-3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Kana tin, Timote nadi ɛ́ nyɛ moo mot ngot tɔ bot ɛ nadi egyee mɛlu djas bɛ nɛ Pɔl mot-lwoma ɔ. Tin, nyɛ nadi ekyeed nyɛ, nyɛ tɔ́ bɛtɛ mɛdjoŋ mɛ ɛkɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. Pɔl nadi ekyekyeed nyɛ é bɛtɛ nɛ elwomel na lyel-lyel pɛ daa bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala nadi tɔ etɛp ɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ din ɛ Timote di elaŋaa tɔ mɛkana mɛ Mɛsa mɛ bot ɛ lwoma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 17:14-15">Mɛs 17.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:5">18.5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:22">19.22</ref></char>) nɛghu tɔ bɛdhiiti bɛmɛkana mɛ Pɔl (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 4:17">1Ko 4.17</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 16:10-11">16.10-11</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 2:19-24">Fil 2.19-24</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 3:2-6">1Te 3.2-6</ref></char>). Bɛmɛkana mɛmbá mɛ Pɔl nakyeeb nɛ Timote ɛ, nɛ yii nyɛ nakyeeb nɛ Tit ɛ, ye djóoaa ɛ́ «bɛmɛkana mɛ bot ɛ mɛsa ɛ Zɛɛb». Ye nasael deenek ɛ́, kɔ ɛsu ɛ mɛtiŋ nadjɛaa nɛ «bot ɛ mɛsa ɛ Zɛɛb» ɛ, nɛghu bot ɛ di edjɛɛd ndjaa mendjaala ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="em">Mɛkana mɛ mɛkɛn nakyeedaa Timote</char> ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛsuk mɛlɛl mɛ di elyaal ɛ. Ye kan sok ɛ, ɛdul ɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛlo kɔ ɛsu ɛ embee mɛdjek. Yɛ ɛ́ embee mɛlyo mɛ di esɛɛg mɛfulu mɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda, nɛ yii bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis, mɛlyo mɛ bɛdhiiti bot di etetɔ́ nɛ ɛlyo bot ɛ. Embee mɛlyo menek tel bot ɛ náá, etɛp ee di tɔ sɔ ɛ di enyɔ. Bɛ nabaadi elyo ɛ́ náá, bot aabela tsik ɛ́, kɔ ɛsu ɛ esa ee bot di egu tɔ sɔ ɛ. Yɛ ɛpebaalyak náá, sa bot ɛ́ ààdɛ edhiiti membi mɛ edee, nɛ ɛbyen ɛba mɛba.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mɛ ɛpebaadjɛ mɛtiŋ dum nɛ mendjaala, dáa zɛɛga mendjaala di egoka nɛ ɛkɛ ɛ, zɛnɔɔ dhatyee bɛdjɛɛdel di egoka nɛ ɛdjɛɛd zɛɛga mendjaala ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɛ mɛsik mɛ mɛkana, ye ɛpedjɛ mɛlyo nɛ Timote étɛp nyɛ neegu dáa nyɛ di egoka nɛ ɛsa mɛsa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Dɔɔ nɛ ɛkwyee membi mɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ di tɔ ndjaa mendjaala ɔ, étɛp nyɛ needi mbɛɛ mot-mɛsa ɛ Yezu Klisto (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 4:6">4.6</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Tin, bot ɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛke náá, mɛkana mak ɛ́ nɛ mɛsuk mɛmbá: ɛsuk wat ɛ́ mɛlyo dum nɛ bot ɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala djas, nɛ bɛdjɛɛdel bɔɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 1-3">1–3</ref></char>), ye kabɛ yak ɛsuk ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ mɛlyo dum nɛ mɛsa mɛ Timote nyɛ ɛmet (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 4-6">4–6</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ye tok náá, bɛ besal ɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala nɛghu bɛdjɛɛdel náá, bɛ di nɛ ɛlooba nɛ bhel ààkwyii-ko. Tin, yɛ ɛ́, ɛwa lyem tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ di egoka nɛ ɛdi pyeta tɔ mendjaala nɛ ɛduwal ɛ Yezu Klisto, Mɛtsik-bot yenaka (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 2:3-6">2.3-6</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Yɛ ɛ́ mam Pɔl, mot-lwoma ɛ Yezu Klisto tɔ ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb Mɛtsik-bot yenaka, nɛ tɔ ɛkwosak ɛ Yezu Klisto, ɛbwaalel ɛ lenaka.<verse eid="1TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />Mɛ kwyal ɛ́ wɔy Timote tɛtɛ mɔn'am tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb mɛkana mak. Beta náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ, nɛ lyem ghoŋ, zɛnɔɔ egwyem di edus pɛ daa Zɛɛb Sɛɛg nɛ pɛ daa Yezu Klisto Ghɛŋ'enaka ɛ, di nɛ nɔ.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛdul ɛ bot mɛlɔ dum nɛ embee mɛlyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Dáa mɛ nake nɛ nɔ é sok mɛ nadi etɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Masedwan ɛ, dia tɔ ghaada Efɛɛz. Etɛɛ náá, penek ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ di elyo bot embee mɛlyo ɔ. É di'enek, ye goka ɛ́ wɔ bhɛm bɛ, bɛ kat. <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />Lɛɛa bɛ náá, bɛ bet ɛsesa esua-esua nɛ ɛlaŋ ɛ ekɔkɔ e mɛbyel yii bɛpaa di ààsi ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ ɛpewaaz bot nɛ ɛdjóo ɛ́ mɛwɔ. Tin, ɛkaada etɛp binek ààsa náá, mot sa mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb di enyen tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ.<verse eid="1TI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Tin, ɛsuk ɛ bɛmɛlyo mak djas ɛ́, étɛp bot neekwyɛla pak'ɔɔ nɛ lyem sɛŋ, nɛ tɛtɛ esiiza, nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko bhimis pɛ si ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Bɛdhiiti bɛmbee bɛlyoel naazekat ɛsa etɛtɛ etɛp binek. Tin, bɛ lii ɛ́ etɛp mbɛs di ààbɛ nɛ lo nɛ mɛko ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Deenek, bɛ ɛpekwyɛl ɛlyaal bot náá, bɛ ɛ́ bɛtɛtɛ bɛlyoel ɛ etsi e Zɛɛb. Tin, bɔɔ bɛmet ààgu sa bɛ di elɛɛ ɛ, nɛ sa bɛ di elyo bot ɛ.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Mena nɛ guka náá, etsi e Zɛɛb nɛ nyɔ, ye nyɔ ɛ́, yɛ bɛ náá, mena nɛ kɛka dáa ye di elɛɛ ɔɔ. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Tin, ye nyɔ ɛ́, bot guka náá, etsi nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjɛaa étɛp bot ɛ epiki. Etsi nadjɛaa ɛ́ étɛp bot ɛ di ààlooba nɛ etsi ɔ, bot ɛ ɛlyel ɛ lo, bot ɛ mbee lyem, bot ɛ mesyem, bot ɛ di ààkaab Zɛɛb nɛ esa e dɛɛ ɔ, bot ɛ di egó bɛsɛɛg bɔɔ nɛ bɛnyɛɛg bɔɔ ɔ, bot ɛ di egó bot ɔ, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />bot ɛ mɛzɔ, botom ɛ di esɛɛga goŋ nɛ bɛsɔ bɔɔ botom ɔ, bot ɛ di ebɔmsa ekwom e bot ɔ, bot ɛ etsal, bot ɛ di esu elɛŋ e etsal ɔ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ-bɛak étɛp bot ɛ di esa edhiiti esa ee di àànɔŋel nɛ mbɛɛ mɛlyo mɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Mɛlyo menek ɛ́ tɔ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal nadjɛaa mɛ ɛ. Mbɛɛ Bhaadal tak dus ɛ́ pɛ daa Zɛɛb, mot di nɛ duma nɛ enɛm esa ɔ.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Mɛ ɛpebulal bhɔɔ nɛ mot nadjɛ mɛghwyil ɔ, Yezu Klisto Ghɛŋ'enaka. Mɛ ɛpebulal nyɛ bhɔɔ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ eetɔ mɛ, nɛ ɛwa ɛbwaalel ɛ lɛ tɔ lam, nɛ ɛnɔŋ ɛ́ mɛ dáa mot-mɛsa mɛ. <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />É ghɛŋ sok, mɛ nadi elee nyɛ, mɛ nadi etiig nyɛ, mɛ nadi ɛ́ tɔ embee etɛp. Tin, Klisto eegek mɛ ghoŋ. Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààgu sa mɛ nadi esa ɛ, etɛɛ náá, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdum koŋ nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Tin, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka nadyeebabu kɔ lam. Nyɛ eesa náá, mɛ di nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ nɛ, mɛ di nɛ ghwyil ɛkwyɛl ɛ bot kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛgwakel ɛ lam nɛ Yezu Klisto ɛ.<verse eid="1TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Gwakeka mɛkpa mɛ etsɛɛtsɛ ee bot djas di egoka nɛ ɛmyaal yɛ ɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 1:15">Yezu Klisto nazyɛ kɔ bɔs'ak ɛ́ étɛp ɛtsik bot ɛ mesyem.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 1:15">Mɛ ɛ́ mot mɛkɛn tɔ lɔɔ.<verse eid="1TI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Tin, nyɛ naagek mɛ ghoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 1:16">etɛɛ náá, Yezu Klisto neelyaal boo lyem goŋ'ɛ di ààbɛ nɛ ɛsik ɛ nɛ mam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 1:16">mot di na-ghaa mesyem ɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 1:16">Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ́, étɛp bot ɛ aaboodum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 1:16">neebela tsik na kɔm-kɔm.<verse eid="1TI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Ye goka ɛ́ náá, bot djas duwal Zɛɛb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 1:17">nɛ ɛdjɛ nyɛ duma na kɔm-kɔm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 1:17">Nyɛy ɛ́ mɛkoozi mɛ di ààbɛ nɛ ɛsik ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 1:17">nyɛ ààgwyɛ, mot di ààbeeaa ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 1:17">yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ di tɛtɛ Zɛɛb na kɔm-kɔm! <char style="sc">Amɛn</char>!<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛduu ɛ tɛtɛ tuub</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Gwaka sa mɛ di elɛɛ wɔ ɛ, Timote mɔn'am, yenek ɛ́ mɛlyo mɛ mɛ djɛ wɔ ɛ, dáa bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb naloolɛɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔ ɛ. Wɔ taala mɛkpa menek ɔɔ, wɔ waabela ghwyil, tin ɛ́ wɔ aakaduu tɛtɛ tuub. <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />Étɛp ɛsa deenek, wɔ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛpyet tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb nɛ mbɛɛ lyem. Bɛdhiiti bot moo ɛ́ ààkabɛ nɛ mbɛɛ lyem, deenek, bɛ eezekwyital ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Tɔ lɔɔg'ɔɔ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ Yimɛnɛ bɛ nɛ Alɛkzandɛlɛ, bot ɛ mɛ naka bɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ Satan, étɛp bɛ needjek ɛkat ɛlee ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo dum nɛ mendjaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Gwakeka sa mɛkɛn mɛ di ebesal bin náá bi sa ɛ: djaalaka é ɛwaab esa ee bi di nɛ gwyes nɛ ye ɛ, nɛ elɛka, nɛ ɛdjɛ bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb dum nɛ bot djas. <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />Tin, djaalaka Zɛɛb étɛp bɛmɛkoozi djas, zɛnɔɔ bot djas di edi ekukuma ɔ, étɛp bot needi tɔ tɛtɛ tsik di egoka ɛ, nɛ egwyem, nɛ ɛkaab ɛ Zɛɛb, tɔ tɛtɛ kwyɛl nɛ duu djas nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Beea sa di ɛnyɔɛpe é mis ɛ Zɛɛb Mɛtsik-bot menaka ɛ: <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />Zɛɛb kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, bot djas bela tsik, da bɛ ɛ́ gu etsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Zɛɛb ɛ́ ngɔt, tin, mot di eduula pak bot ɛ bɔs nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ yɛ ɛ́ mot ngɔt, mot tak ɛ́ Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />Nyɛy ɛ́ nadjɛ tsik'ɛ met étɛp ɛpɛk bot djas. É ghɛŋ ɛwala tak nadjala ɛ, nyɛ naazɛdjɛ tseŋa di elyaal náá, ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ náá, bot djas tsak. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ ààpakɔɔ bin, Zɛɛb naadjɛ mɛ di ɛdi ɛ́ lyoel nɛ mot-lwoma yɛ. Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ́, étɛp mɛ neelyo bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛfulu mɛ boa nɛ botom tɔ zɛɛga mendjaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, é edi djas, botom djaala Zɛɛb nɛ mɛmbɔ mɔɔ e edɛɛ bena pɛ ɛko. Sa bɛ ààdi nɛ ɛbuk tɔ lyem, sa bɛ ààdi bot ɛ mɛwɔ.<verse eid="1TI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Tyee wat nɛ boa, mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, boa di nɛ tɛtɛ bhet. Bɛ di nɛ tɛtɛ ekaad di egoka náá, bot bee ɛ, sa bɛ ààdi nɛ embee epyeeda elo mbɛs di epyeeda étɛp ɛtela nyel ɛ. Sa bɛ ààkomsa mɛnyel nɛ mɛsum mɛ lɔɔd, nɛ bɛmɛvunga nɛ mɛsum nɛghu ekaad di nɛ mɛtaŋ ɛlyelɛpe ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />Tin, bɛ goka nɛ ɛlyaal ɛ enɛm bɔɔ ɛ́ tɔ embɛɛ mɛsa mɔɔ, dáa bɛtɛtɛ boa di eduwal Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />É ɛwala ɛ mɛlyo di elyoaa ɛ, boa goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ gwyem é gwak mɛlyo tɔ mɛsila djas. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Mɛ ààpadjɛ ze náá, moma djɛ mɛlyo nɛghu ɛkɔk kɔ motom. Moma goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi gwyeema, é ghɛŋ nyɛ di egwak mɛlyo ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb naleekus ɛ́ Adam motom, bhii tak Ɛve moma. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Tin, ye tok Adam nakɔɔaa, yɛ ɛ́ moma. Moma ɛ́ nakɔɔaa, bhii tak, nyɛ naazɛkwyɛ ndjɛ é mis ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Tin, moma aazobela tsik ɛ́, é sok nyɛ aabya ɛ, moma tak ɛ di ekɛ tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ kwyɛl, tɔ epiki, nɛ tɔ tsik edɛɛ ɔɔ.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Bot ɛ di ekukuma e zɛɛga mendjaala ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Beeka mɛkpa mɛ bot djas di egoka nɛ ɛwa ɛbwaalel ɛ: Yɛ bɛ náá, mot ɛpekwyɛl ɛdi ngɔt tɔ bɛdjɛɛdel ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ɔɔ, nyɛ kwyɛl tin ɛ́ ɛsa embɛɛ mɛsa. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Ye goka ɛ́ náá, djɛɛdel ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala di mot epiki, nyɛ di ngom moma ngɔt, nyɛ di mot ɛdil ɛ lyem, sa nyɛ ààdi mot ɛdheka ɛ lyem, nyɛ di mot mbɛɛ mɛfulu, nyɛ di mot di emyaal náá bɛdjoŋ sulal pɛ yɛ ɔ, nyɛ di mot di edjɛ bɔɔ bɛsɔ mɛlyo ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />Sa nyɛ ààdi mot elangi, na ghaa etuub, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi mot mɛtela, ààdi mot mɛwɔ nɛghu mot di ekwyɛl epata dhaa tyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Tin, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdjɛɛd bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ ɛnyɔɛpe, bɔn bɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlooba nɛ nɛ ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Bela náá, mot ɛ di ààgu ɛdjɛɛd bil'ɛ met ɛnyɔɛpe ɔ, haaa nyɛ aakadjɛɛd zɛɛga mendjaala ɛ Zɛɛb dáa? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Tin, sa nyɛ ààdi mot di náá, nyɛ aaloo nɛ ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. Yɛ àànyɔ deenek ekaab náá, nyɛ ɛ́ ɛzɛkɛsa ɛbet, bhii tak, da nyɛ ɛ́ bela baka tyee dim mot mɛkɔŋ nazebela ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Deenek, ye goka ɛ́ náá, dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ di ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ djɛ nyɛ duu, étɛp bɛ needi ààwyɛlɛ nyɛ, tin, nyɛ needi ààkwyit tɔ mɛbhowal mɛ dim mot mɛkɔŋ.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Edhyakɛlɛ e zɛɛga mendjaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Deenek, yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ edhyakɛlɛ, bɛ goka ɛ́ bɛ di bot ɛ mɛdil. Sa bɛ ààdi bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko bhimis pɛ si, ààdi bot ɛ elangi, bɛ ààgoka nɛ ɛdi bot ɛ di ekwyɛl ɛbela epata ààbɛ náá, bɛ eesa mɛsa ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />Tin, bɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbaal etsɛɛtsɛ e ɛdum koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb nɛ lyem sɛŋ. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Bɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdhaa tɔ mɛbhowal. Yɛ kabɛ náá, bɛ tok nɛ dhiiti tɛp di ekɔɔla nɛ nɔɔ ɔɔ, é di'enek, bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛkasa mɛsa mɛ edhyakɛlɛ. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Tin, bɛl bɔɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bɛl bɔɔ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdi edhyakɛlɛ boa.</char></note> goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdil ɛ mɛnyel mɔɔ, sa bɛ ààdi bot ɛ ɛbyak ɛ́ bot, ààdi bot ɛ ebeyak, ye goka ɛ́ bɛ di sosoob é etɛp djas. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Dhyakɛlɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ ngom moma ngɔt, da nyɛ ɛ́ di mot di djɛɛd bɔn bɛ nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ ɛnyɔɛpe ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Deenek, edhyakɛlɛ ɛ di esa mɛsa mɔɔ ɛnyɔɛpe ɔɔ, bot djas ɛ́ waadjɛ bɛ duu. Tin, bɛ waadi nɛ ghwyil ɛlii nɛ ɛbwaalel djas kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, mot di esɛɛg mena nɛ Yezu Klisto ɔ.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Boo sa sɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Mɛ kwyal wɔ etɛp bak ɛ́, nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, mɛ moo aazyɛ zɛbee wɔ. <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />Tin, mɛ bɔya ɔɔ, wɔ waagu dáa wɔ aagoka nɛ ɛsa étɛp ɛdjɛɛd bil ɛ Zɛɛb, di zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ Zɛɛb di nɛ tsik ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ zɛɛga tak ɛ di ɛgwyiŋ ɛ di epyet etsɛɛtsɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Tsɛɛtsɛ, sa sɔ di tɔ ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb'enaka ɛ nɛ bɔk:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Klisto nazyɛ kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ́ dáa bot djas di ezyɛ ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">yɛ ɛ́ Sisim na Dɛɛ ɛ nalyaal náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mot epiki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mot epiki </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sisim na Dɛɛ naalɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ «mɔn'am mɛ di kwyɛl ɔ» <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 3:16-17">Mat 3.16-17</ref></char>.</char></note>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Nyɛ naatel efofop nyel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">bot naagoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ daa bot ɛ mɛdhik mɛ sis kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Bhii tak, bɛtɛ nɛ bot naadum koŋ nɛ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">É di'enek, nyɛ naazɛbela duma ɛ Zɛɛb tɔ gwoo.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Bot ɛ di elyo bot embee mɛlyo ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Tin, Sisim na Dɛɛ nalɛɛ popoopwon ɛ́ náá, bot ɛ kum é ɛwala ɛ mɛsik ɔɔ, bɛdhiiti bot ɛ́ waakat ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, étɛp ɛdu ɛ esisim ee di ewyel bot ɛ, nɛ ɛdu ɛ embee mɛlyo mɔɔ. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Deenek, bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si, nɛ bot ɛ etsal ɛ́ waakɔɔ bɛ. Esiiza e bot binɔk moo ɛ́ ngwyɛɛla, dáa bot ɛ di náá, elyem bɔɔ ɛ́ nɛ bham bɛ nadikaa nɛ gwooz nazete tɔɔbelaa nɛ mɛgoo mɛ du ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Deenek, mɛlyo mɛ bot binɔk ɛ́ náá, sa mot ààba, sa mot ààdɛ dhiiti membi mɛ edee. Bela náá, Zɛɛb nadjɛ edee binek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ zedum koŋ ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ di egu etsɛɛtsɛ ɔ, dɛ yɛ, nɛ ɛghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Tin, esa ee Zɛɛb nakus djas ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe, ye tok nɛ sa wat aamwasaa tɔ tak. Ye goka ɛ́ náá, bot djɛ Zɛɛb bhɔɔ dum nɛ esa binek. <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />Etɛɛ náá, Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ mendjaala ɛ di esa náá, esa binek djas di dɛɛ é mis ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbɛɛ mot-mɛsa ɛ Yezu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Deenek, wɔ djɛ mɛlyo mak nɛ bɔn-nyoog ɔɔ, wɔ aadi ɛ́ mbɛɛ mot-mɛsa ɛ Yezu Klisto. Wɔ waalyaal náá, yɛ ɛ́ mɛkpa mɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb nɛ tɛtɛ mɛlyo ɛ́ di edee bɔ. Mɛlyo mak djas, wɔ naabaal yɛ ɛnyɔɛpe tɔ lo'ɔ <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Tin, wɔ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛmwas esa e esua-esua di esaab dék ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Deenek, saŋa náá, wɔ di sosoob nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Guka náá, ɛsa mɛsɛŋ mɛ mɛboola ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe étɛp nyel. Bela náá, ɛdi ɛ́ sosoob nɛ Zɛɛb nɛ nyɔ dhaa esonok djas! Etɛɛ náá, mos yɛ ɛpedjɛ mena ɛbwaalel, nɛ ɛbaakɛk mena tsik na kɔm-kɔm.<verse eid="1TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Yɛ ɛ́ embɛɛ mɛkpa mɛ etsɛɛtsɛ ee bot djas di egoka nɛ ɛwa ɛbwaalel ɛ, ye goka ɛ́ mot djas myaal yɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Yɛ bɛ náá, bot ɛ ɛpezuk nɛ ɛwa zii tɔ mɛsa ɔɔ, yɛ ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bot naazewa ɛbwaalel nɛ Zɛɛb di nɛ tsik ɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ di Mɛtsik-bot, yii bot djas, daŋ-daŋ ɛ́, bot zedum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɔ.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Yenek ɛ́ sa wɔ di egoka nɛ ɛlyo, nɛ ɛlyaal ɛ bot ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Tin, sa mot ààbee wɔ é mis toto, etɛɛ náá, wɔ ɛ́ ngbaaz. Tin, wɔ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ mot bot djas aadu mɛfulu mɛ ɔ, tɔ mɛkpa, tɔ mɛfulu, tɔ kwyɛl, tɔ ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb nɛ tɔ edɛɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Ɛsok nɛ mɛ nɛ kum, wa lyem tɔ ɛlaa Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb é mis mɛ bot djas, djɛ bɛ mɛghaaz, lyoa bɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Tin, sa wɔ ààpel ɛkɛɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ ee Zɛɛb nadjɛ wɔ ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ ɛkɛɛ Zɛɛb wɔ nabela é ghɛŋ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nalii ɛ, da bɛpaa ɛ́ kɛl wɔ mɛmbɔ ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Tin, wa lyem tɔ etɛp binek djas, da wɔ ɛ́ wa zii tɔ mɛsa mɔ. É di'enek, bot djas ɛ wabee dáa mɛsa mɔ di etɔ́ sok ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Wɔ ɛ́ kobaka nɛ nyel'ɔ met, nɛ mɛlyo mɔ. Wa zii esa yɛ, wɔ di esa deenek ɔɔ, wɔ aatsik nyel'ɔ met nɛ ɛbaatsik bot ɛ di egwak mɛlyo mɔ ɛ.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo dum nɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Wɔ di edul tɔa-mot mɛlɔ ɔɔ, sa wɔ ààkabiyo-biyoak, wɔ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlii nɛ nɛ, ɛkɛɛ wɔ lii ɛ nɛ soog. Yɛ kabɛ mengbaaz ɔɔ, nɔŋa bɛ dáa bɔn-nyoog. <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />Deenek, da wɔ ɛ́ nɔɔ bɛtɔa-boa dáa bɛnyoog, mɛsyes dáa bɛkɛl bɔ, sa wɔ ààdi nɛ egeka ɛsyem nɛ nɔɔ.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />É di'enek, da wɔ ɛ́ gheekwyee-kwyee bɛkus ɛ boa, yii wɔ di egu náá, bɛ tok nɛ bot ɛ kwyee bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Yɛ bɛ náá, kus moma ɛ́ nɛ bɔn nɛghu bɛdha ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, bɛ sa mɛsa mɛ di elyaal ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, pɛ daa bɛbyael bɔɔ, zɛnɔɔ bɛbhaab bɔɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bɛ aabulal enɛm esa ee bɛ nasa bɛ ɛ. Yenek ɛ́ sa di ɛnyɔɛpe é mis ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Tin, kus moma na tsɛɛtsɛ di náá, nyɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛmet, ààbɛ nɛ mot ɛkwyee nyɛ ɔ, nyɛ wa ɛbwaalel ɛ lɛ nɛ Zɛɛb. Deenek, nyɛ ààkat ɛdjaala mwos nɛ pum étɛp ɛwaab náá, Zɛɛb kwyee nyɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Yɛ kabɛ kus di egyee nɛ ɛkwosak ɛ lyem'ɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ moo ɛ́ nyɛ eezegwyɛ, ye nakoozodi náá, nyɛ nɛ tsik. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Beea sa wɔ di egoka nɛ ɛlɛɛ nɛ bɛkus ɛ boa, étɛp bɛ needi ààbɛ nɛ embee mɛfulu ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Yɛ bɛ náá, mot ààsa enɛm esa nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ met ɔɔ, nɛghu bot ɛ́ bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ di tɔ ndjaa wat ɔɔ, nyɛ swonal ɛ́ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɛ nɛ Zɛɛb. É di'enek, nyɛ ɛpesa ɛbiyo dhaa-dhaŋak bot ɛ di ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Étɛp din ɛ kus moma neekwyalaa tɔ mɛkana mɛ bɛkus, ye goka ɛ́ náá, moma tak di nɛ membu tyee mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ wat (60) kɛdhaa. Da nyɛ ɛ́ di náá, nyɛ nazodi ɛ́ nɛ motom ngɔt. <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />Nyɛ di moma di náá, bot djas nɛ gu náá, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ embɛɛ mɛsa ɔ: Nyɛ naalyo bɔn bɛ ɛnyɔɛpe, yɛ ɛ́ moma di emyaal náá, bɛdjoŋ sulal pɛ yɛ ɔ, mot di egwyii bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ mɛko ɔ, mot di ekwyee bot di tɔ edjel ɔ. Deenek, nyɛ di mot ɛsa membi mɛ enɛm esa djas ɔ.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Tin, yɛ kabɛ mɛsyes mɛ boa di bɛkus ɔɔ, sa wɔ ààkwyal min mɔɔ tɔ mɛkana. Etɛɛ náá, é ghɛŋ gwyes ɛba ɛ́ aabaasa bɛ ɛ, bɛ waalum koŋ nɛ Klisto. <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />Bɛ sa deenek ɔɔ, bɛ waabela ndjɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi sosoob nɛ sa bɛ natuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />É di'enek, dáa bɛ moo ààkabɛ nɛ sa ɛsa ɛ, bɛ kakekɛ ɛ́ mendjaa nɛ mendjaa. Dáa ɛkɛ mendjaa nɛ mendjaa di ààdjaala nɛ nɔɔ ɛ, mɛsa mɔɔ aakadi ɛ́ ɛlii etɛp mbɛs-mbɛs di ààgwyák bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ́, mam Pɔl di edjɛ wɔ mɛlyo mak: mɛsyes mɛ boa di bɛkus ɔ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛtɔ́ mɛba, da bɛ ɛ́ bya bɔn, bɛ sa mɛsa tɔ mendjaa mɛ mɛba mɔɔ. Mɛ ke deenek ɛ́ ekaab náá, mot mɛbhuka mɔɔ ɛzɛkɛlii esonok mbɛs kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔɔ. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Mɛ ke deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bɛdhiiti bɛkus ɛ boa eezewo ze, tin, bɛ kadu ɛ́ Satan mot mɛkɔŋ. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, moma di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ nɛ bɛkus ɛ boa tɔ mɛbyel mɛ ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet kwyee bɛ. Yɛ àànyɔ náá, etɛp binek djas zodi kɔ elo e bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala. Sa deenek, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala neekwyee bɛkus ɛ boa di bɔɔ bɛmet ɔ.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛpaa ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Bɛpaa di edjɛɛd zɛɛga mendjaala ɛnyɔɛpe ɔ, bɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbela duu edi é sok ebá, daŋ-daŋ ɛ bot ɛ di ewa lyem tɔ mɛsa mɛ mɛlyo, nɛ bot ɛ di egoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Etɛɛ náá, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: «Sa wɔ ààdiyal nuub ngɔmbɛ é ghɛŋ nyɛ di enyal bhum ble ɛ<note caller="*" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Dɛt 25.4</ref></char></note>.» Nɛ náá: «Mot-mɛsa djas goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbela efute.»<verse eid="1TI 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Tin, sa wɔ ààmyaal mɛpita mɛ paa ngɔt aazɛpit mot pɛ daa lɔ ɛ. Wɔ myaal ɛ́, yɛ bɛ náá, bot ɛbá nɛghu bot ɛlɛl ɛ zɛpit nyɛ pɛ daa lɔ ɔɔ<note caller="*" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Dɛt 19.15</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Yɛ bɛ bot ɛ di esa mesyem ɔɔ, liia nɛ nɔɔ é mis mɛ bot djas, etɛɛ náá bɛdhiiti bot neegwak bwoo. <verse eid="1TI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ nɔ é mis ɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ é mis ɛ Yezu Klisto, zɛnɔɔ é mis mɛ efofop ee Zɛɛb naasɛ́ɛ ɔ náá, wɔ looba nɛ esa djas mɛ lɛɛ wɔ ɛ, sa wɔ ààwa mbɛk pak bot, ààkwyɛɛg mot ngɔt dhaa sɔ. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Sa wɔ ààleesuu ɛkɛl mot mɛmbɔ étɛp ɛdjɛ nyɛ di mɛsa tɔ zɛɛga mendjaala. Sa wɔ ààni tɔ mesyem mɛ bot. Wɔ goka ɛ́ wɔ baal nyel'ɔ dɛɛ.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Sa wɔ ààdedɛ mɛdii nɛ mɛdii toto, ye nyɔ ɛ́ náá, wɔ dedɛ ba mɛnyok mɛ vin étɛp mɔ yɔ, dáa ye di náá ɛbɛ́ ɛ mɔ yɔ tak nɛ dhek wɔ ngwyis ɛ.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Mesyem mɛ bɛdhiiti bot nyen ɛ́ popoopwon, ɛsok nɛ bɛ nɛ pɛ́ɛ bɛ. Bela náá, pɛ daa bak bot, ye nyen ɛ́, ɛbhis. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Tin, tyee wat nɛ enɛm esa e bɛdhiiti bot, ye nɛ nyen popoopwon, yɛ kabɛ pɛ daa bak bot ɔɔ, yɛ ààleenyen.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="s">Dáa bɛkwom ɛ bot di egoka nɛ ɛdi ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Tin, ekwom e bot goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbee ekukuma bɔɔ ɛ, dáa bot ɛ di egoka nɛ duu é esonok djas ɛ. Ye goka ɛ́ bɛ sa deenek etɛɛ náá, din ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ mɛlyo mɛ mena di elyo ɛ́ needi ààbyaselaa. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ekukuma di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, sa bɛ ààbyasal bɛ etɛɛ náá, bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ ɛ́ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ wat. Ye nyɔ ɛ́ náá, bɛ sa mɛsa mɛ bɛ di esa pɛ daa ekukuma bɔɔ ɛ ɛnyɔɛpe, etɛɛ náá, bɛ sa mɛsa ɛ́ pɛ daa bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɔ.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Embee mɛlyo nɛ tɛtɛ mɛvu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Gwaka sa wɔ di egoka nɛ ɛlyo, nɛ ɛlɛɛ náá bɛ sa ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Bɛdhiiti bot ɛpelyo embee mɛlyo mɛ sis, di ààgoka nɛ yii Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto ɛ. Bɛ ààlyo bot mɛlyo mɛ di ekɛ lɔɔg wat nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lena nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />Binɔk bot ɛ́, bot ɛghɛɛa nyel, bɛ ààgu sonok. Kwyɛl mɛwɔ nɛ ɛsuu ɛ mɛso dum nɛ mɛkpa ɛ́ tɔ lɔɔ tɔɔɔ dáa ɛbɛ́. Mɛwu, mɛwɔ, nɛ mɛlee zɛnɔɔ mbee esiiza dum nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg dus ɛ́ tin. <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />Bɛ nɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ ɛsuu ɛ mɛso mɛ di ààbɛ nɛ ɛsik ɛ pak'ɔɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ di náá, esiiza bɔɔ moo ɛ́ epila dáa endjemet, bɛ ààgu etsɛɛtsɛ. Egeka bɔɔ ɛ́ náá, ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ dhiiti mbi mɛpek mɛ ɛbela ekum.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ boo mɛvu, wɔ di emyaala nɛ sa wɔ di nɛ yɛ ɔɔ. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Etɛɛ náá, bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ nɛ dhiiti sonok kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs'ak, yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ é sok bot aasik ɛ, bot aanàsik nɛ dhiiti sonok. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />É di'enek, mena dika nɛ sa dek nɛ ekaad ɔɔ, yɛ eedjala nɛ nena. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Tin, bot ɛ di esaa náá, bɛ di nɛ mɛvu ɔ, bɛ nɛ kwyɛ tɔ mɛbhowal. Bɛ ɛ́ tɔ laab dum nɛ embee mɛkwosak mɛ ewo di esa náá, bot di tɔ mezuk nɛ ɛwo ɛ́ ze, nɛ ɛdul ɛ bot tɔ ɛsyee ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Etɛɛ náá, kwyɛl epata ɛ́ ɛsuk ɛ embee etɛp djas. Bɛdhiiti bot ɛ nakwyɛl ɛsa deenek ɔ, bɛ moo mos ɛ́ bɛ eezewo ze ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. Tin, bɔɔ bɛmet ɛ saa náá, bɛ zuk.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo ɛ Pɔl pɛ daa Timote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Wɔy mot-mɛsa ɛ Zɛɛb, sa wɔ ààsa etɛp binek. Saŋa ɛdi mot epiki, mot ɛgwakel nɛ Zɛɛb, tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ kwyɛl, nɛ ɛmaad ɛ lyem zɛnɔɔ ɛtela ɛ lyem. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Duua tɛtɛ tuub ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, baala tsik na kɔm-kɔm, yii Zɛɛb nadjóo wɔ étɛp tak ɛ, é ghɛŋ wɔ natuud embɛɛ mɛkpa mɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔ nɛ Yezu Klisto é mis mɛ bot ɛbuɛpe ɛ, <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />nɛ é mis ɛ Zɛɛb mot di edjɛ tsik nɛ bot djas ɔ, é mis ɛ Yezu Klisto mot nalɛɛ bot embɛɛ mɛkpa mɛ tak é mis mɛ Pɔɔs Pilat ɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">embɛɛ mɛkpa mɛ tak é mis mɛ Pɔɔs Pilat ɔ <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 18:36-37">Zaŋ 18.36-37</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:11">19.11</ref></char></char></note>, mɛ lɛɛ wɔ ɛ́ náá: <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />Looba nɛ mɛtiŋ mɛ wɔ bela ɛ, sa yɛ ààpulel, baala yɛ ɛnyɔɛpe kɛkum dwoo Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto aatuula ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Tin, ɛtuula ɛ Klisto aadi ɛ́ é ɛwala ɛ Zɛɛb nazekoobal ɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 6:15">Nyɛy ɛ́ di kɔ elo e ekukuma djas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 6:15">nyɛy ɛdi ɛsuk ɛ mɛnyɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 6:15">Mɛkoozi mɛ bɛmɛkoozi, Ghɛŋ bɛghɛŋ.<verse eid="1TI 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />Nyɛ ɛmet ɛ́ tsik na kɔm-kɔm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 6:16">nyɛ ɛ́ tɔ mɛkas mɛ di náá, mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ ɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 6:16">Mot ngɔt kɔ bɔs dináá ààpabee nyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 6:16">mot tok pe nɛ ghwyil ɛbee nyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 6:16">Duu nɛ mɛbwala di nɛ nɛ kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm! <char style="sc">Amɛn</char>!<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo dum nɛ bɛkum ɛ bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Deenek, lɛɛa nɛ bot ɛ di nɛ mɛvu kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs'ak ɔ náá, sa bɛ ààdi bot ɛ ɛghɛɛa nyel. Baalɛɛ nɛ nɔɔ náá, sa bɛ ààwa ɛbwaalel ɛ lɔɔ tɔ mɛvu mɛ di ààbɔya ɛ. Tin, bɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛwa ɛbwaalel ɛ lɔɔ ɛ́ nɛ Zɛɛb, mot di edjɛ mena esonok dhaa mɛbu ɔ, étɛp mena needika tɔ mɛmyaala. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Lɛɛa nɛ nɔɔ náá, bɛ sa enɛm esa, bɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ bot ɛ mɛvu tɔ enɛm esa, nɛ elyem ɛgek ɛ́ bɛsɔ bɔɔ ghoŋ, bɛ di bot ɛ ɛgwyena. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Bɛ di esa deenek ɔɔ, bɛ waasɛɛg tɛtɛ mɛkwom, étɛp ɛbela tɛtɛ tsik.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo mɛ mɛsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Wɔy Timote, baala ɛnyɔɛpe sa nadjɛaa wɔ ɛ, kyeea embee melɛŋ di ààkɛ sama nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, sa wɔ ààsuu mɛso nɛ elɛŋ etsal bɛ di eke náá, yɛ ɛ́ etsɛɛtsɛ ɛ. <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Deenek, bɛdhiiti bot ɛ nadu embee mɛlyo nɛ elɛŋ etsal binek ɔ, bɛ moo ɛ́ bɛ eezewo ze tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Tin, beta náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ Zɛɛb di nɛ nɔ.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>